        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Genève-Servette HC, National League, Servette FC\n- People: Hugh Quennec\n- Places: Geneva, Switzerland\n- Topics: Swiss ice hockey, league naming\n\nFacts:\n- Hugh Quennec was born on 28 June 1965.\n- Prior to the 2017–18 season, the National League was officially called National League A.\n- Genève-Servette HC is a professional ice hockey club based in Geneva, Switzerland.\n- Genève-Servette HC is also called Servette or GSHC.\n- Genève-Servette HC competes in the National League, the top tier of the Swiss hockey league system.\n- Hugh Quennec is the current principal owner and president of Genève-Servette HC.\n- Hugh Quennec is the current principal owner and president of Servette FC.",
